Z||000000||contra||09-19-2000||04:53 PM||||Hi-Tech  is a new fiero shop (well new to me since i never heard of them before) and i was wondering if anybody in the ontario/toronto region has dealt with them. their prices are extremely cheap and they're going to do some exhaust work on my fiero for less than anywhere i've gotten quotes from. They do alot of work especially V8 conversions for $2500 canadian if you can supply the engine and the kit. That's pretty decent i think.<BR>I can't wait to get my manifold crack fixed, because once it's fixed, all i want to do is add a turbo. Eventually some day i'll get my turbo fiero  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
