Z||000003||Sillhouette.com||09-19-2000||06:37 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by contra:<BR><B>yeah<BR>race-tech is the fiero shop i've always dealt with<BR>i havent checked out RSM yet only cause they seem sort of crooked.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Finally got you !!<P>I was wondering if there is anyone on this site that is badmouthing RSM and to my supprise there is.  <P>Questions for your bold statement?<P>What makes you think that RSM is crooked?<BR>How come that your exhaust leak is not fixed by the all mighty Race Tech?<BR>How long have you known Race Tech and RSM?<BR>What do you know about the relationship between Race Tech and RSM?<BR>What do you know about Race Techs lawsuit concerning with one of their clients?<P>I'm certainly awaiting your response <P><BR>||||reg||4
Z||000004||contra||09-19-2000||07:20 PM||||to answer your questions about rsm<P>"What makes you think that RSM is crooked?"<P>I dont think they're totally crooked, but i do find that race-tech sells the same items for alot less money than rsm sells for, and to me, that means alot cause i dont have alot of cash. <P>"How come that your exhaust leak is not fixed by the all mighty Race Tech?"<P>Because Hi-Tech quoted me a much cheaper price, so why bother paying more??   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>"How long have you known Race Tech and RSM?"<P>Since i've owned a fiero, but i wouldn't generally say i ""know"" them. i just purchase stuff there and ask advice.<P>"What do you know about the relationship between Race Tech and RSM?"<P>Nothing<P>"What do you know about Race Techs lawsuit concerning with one of their clients?"<P>nothing, it's news to me<BR><p>[This message has been edited by contra (edited 09-19-2000).]||||reg||1
